  "implemented": [
    "PeerConfig.SCAP1Advertisement explicit enum; default standard. Requires bound SCAP1Accounting policy and exactly one strict Vendor193/Acct19302 local VSAI without Extra",
    "Normal CER/CEA only: exact adjacent source pair sent; redundant dual group removed in owned RX buffer before strict Base/source/header checks. Does not grant Auth19302 or arbitrary App0 admission",
    "Original wire frame/AVP/field/repeat/depth limits counted before removal; TX reserved capacity with forty-four additional bytes; CER and CEA preflight at NewNode; no extra retained frame/worker/queue/budget class",
    "Real TCP/TLS initiator/responder with strict/legacy responses; default rejection, missing capabilities on new generation and no automatic replay; SingleAttempt remains mandatory",
    "ACR/ACA 2001/5012/E multiArrival distinct Proxy, completed cache replay, one-parent content conflict without replacing/refilling original, mutable view isolation and canceled/invalid response preparation",
    "C slot/arrival exhaustion retains existing ErrBackpressure connection-close behavior; active and exhausted Respond/Close cleanup with zero I/C charges"
  ],
